[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i363"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那之后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"8月结束了，我回到了家。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鹭阿姨没有联系过我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我通过各种渠道调查了鸥的消息，但最终没能找到线索。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夏天结束，在慌忙展开的新学期中，和鸥度过的暑假如梦般在我记忆中逐渐淡去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确实，鸥也好，和她一起度过的时间也好，可能真就如同梦幻一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是，即便如此，我偶尔依然会心不在焉地想象。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1292"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那家伙说不定现在也在哪里旅行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"拖着大大的行李箱，我行我素地……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里逛逛，那里晃晃也说不定。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"未来一定还有着许多探险在等着她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那些探险不会像小说一样迎来结尾，而会一直继续下去。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"set","variable":1,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i154"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二年。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夏天再次到来，我来到了岛上。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i408"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那艘船依然停靠在海湾处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"岛上似乎想要保留这艘船，把它作为旅游资源。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船帆叠起，风穿过船身。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我坐在船的一角，任由时间流逝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我忽然注意到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船长室里，好像放着什么东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"浅蓝色的厚信封上写有收件信息。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看了一眼，应该写着寄件地址的地方脏得看不清字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知道收件信息。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2304,"image":"i1293"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这封信，破破烂烂的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然盖着像样的火漆印章，但仔细一看那模造成了一只蓄着胡须的猫咪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"上面盖着数不清的邮戳。英文的邮戳，还有些不知道哪国语的邮戳重叠在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到底是经历了怎样漫长的旅程，才送到这里的啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又或者是既不知道该送往哪也不知道该退回哪的邮递员，听到了海湾这艘船的传闻后送到这里了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仅仅是凭着停泊在这的这艘船上的标记，和火漆印章的标记来判断。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，感觉从信上嗅出了异国的气息。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大海的气味，森林的气味。各种气味混合在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"让人不由地想……这封信，是不是环游了世界。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"经过很长时间……终于来到了这里。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1792},{"op":"clear","layer":2304},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我打开信封。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面折起来的信，依然完好无损。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看了开头，那里出现了意料之外的名字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又或者，说不定，我已经预感到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘鹰原羽依里 先生。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"上面如是写着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我当场打开信，站在原地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"信上只写着简单的寥寥数语。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘我将跨越七大洋去与你相见。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘倾注我所有的爱意。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘海盗胡子猫团·久岛鸥’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i406"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抬头看着船帆，手上拿起绳子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，使劲一拉。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"折叠起来的船帆唰唰落下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风恰到好处地吹着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"停靠着的船，缓缓启动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也踏上旅途就好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"跨越数个海洋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"进行一次漫长的旅行就好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉这样的话，终有一天，我们会在某处相遇。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i147"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"张开双手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像船帆迎风鼓起一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"向着远方的世界，船缓缓前进。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝着光芒的方向。"},{"op":"set","variable":3,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1295"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"set","variable":26005,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":26045,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":26007,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":26010,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在光的另一头，重逢一定在等待着我。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":3,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":26005,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":26045,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":26007,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":26010,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]